{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move. Jump. Go forward. Stuck? Flip it. That's all you can do in this strange, black-and-white space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/extras/618de81cd86bdef9cfefc2f53cca8e37.poster.avif?t=1773298212\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/extras/618de81cd86bdef9cfefc2f53cca8e37.webm?t=1773298212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/extras/618de81cd86bdef9cfefc2f53cca8e37.mp4?t=1773298212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take You\u00a0Home\u00a0is an indie, minimalist, hand-drawn 2D puzzle-platformer. Swap between black and white, flip gravity, and find your way forward. Chase a mysterious black cat that appears from time to time\u2014and see what happens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap black and white and flip gravity to find your way forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 meticulously designed, unique levels. A simple yet emotional story.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 3 controls\u2014easy to pick up and play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items for unexpected surprises?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516450?t=1773298212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516450?t=1773298212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/db31233f867da8f0e7ae3b26d57029ae11aabe8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773298212","capsule_imagev5":"https://share